Bundled editor formatting packages

Inkwell bundles selected Tiptap, ProseMirror, Marked, and OrderedMap packages
locally for rich formatting controls. These packages are MIT licensed.

Bundled package families:

- @tiptap/core
- @tiptap/starter-kit
- @tiptap/extension-text-align
- @tiptap/extension-text-style
- @tiptap/markdown
- @tiptap/pm
- prosemirror-model
- prosemirror-state
- prosemirror-view
- prosemirror-transform
- marked
- orderedmap

